1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,840
(Sheldon:)I'm not unsympathetic to your plight.

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:06,970
(Sheldon:)My father used to say
that a woman is like...

3
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:11,090
(Sheldon:)...an egg salad sandwich
on a warm Texas day.

4
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,760
(Leonard (jumping and knocking over the Jenga):)What?

5
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:18,770
(Sheldon:)Full of eggs and only appealing
for a short time.

6
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:22,090
(Alex:)This conversation
is making me uncomfortable.

7
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:24,130
(Sheldon:)Yeah, you and me both, sister.

8
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:31,610
(Sheldon:)Please understand, I don't hold you
responsible for your behavior.

9
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:36,770
(Sheldon:)From an evolutionary standpoint,
you're a slave to your desire to reproduce.

10
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,490
(Sheldon:)But during the work day...

11
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:42,770
(Sheldon:)...when you feel possessed
by amorous intent, may I suggest...

12
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:46,410
(Sheldon:)...you suppress it by leafing through
this illustrated book...

13
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:48,480
(Sheldon:)...of sexually transmitted diseases.

14
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:53,170
(Sheldon:)Oh, yes. Check out this oozy doozy.

15
00:00:56,440 --> 00:00:57,490
(Alex:)I have to go.

16
00:00:57,680 --> 00:01:07,030
(Sheldon:)So does this fellow, but he
can't without it burning like hot soup.

